      origins: 'Draw Dominoes is documented in published rule references and long-running table play traditions. Modern dominoes first appeared in France in the mid-18th century and spread to Great Britain, Austria, Germany and Italy; Draw Dominoes is one of the simplest and most common Western domino games.',
